# S7-1500 PROFINET Network Configuration for DOL Starter

## PROFINET Network Overview

### Network Topology
```
          HMI/SCADA
              |
        192.168.0.5
              |
      [Network Switch]
              |
        192.168.0.1
              |
    +----------+----------+
    |                     |
192.168.0.10         192.168.0.11
 S7-1500 PLC        (Optional IO)
(DOL Control)      (Remote I/O)
```

## PROFINET Interface Configuration

### Interface X1 (Main PROFINET)
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| IP Address | 192.168.0.10 | Static IP address |
| Subnet Mask | 255.255.255.0 | Network mask |
| Default Gateway | 192.168.0.1 | Router/gateway |
| PROFINET Device Name | S7_1500_DOL_Control | Device identification |
| Device ID | 0x0001 | PROFINET device ID |
| MAC Address | Auto-generated | Hardware MAC address |
| Duplex Mode | Auto | Auto/Full/Half |
| Transmission Rate | Auto | 10/100/1000 Mbps |

### Interface X2 (Optional - for separate network)
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| IP Address | 192.168.1.10 | Isolated network |
| Subnet Mask | 255.255.255.0 | Network mask |
| Default Gateway | 192.168.1.1 | Router/gateway |
| Purpose | Safety/Redundant network | Separate safety network |

