| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Device Name | ET200SP_DOL_IO | Remote I/O station |
| IP Address | 192.168.0.11 | Static IP address |
| Subnet Mask | 255.255.255.0 | Network mask |
| Device Type | ET200SP | Remote I/O type |
| Update Rate | 1 ms | Fast I/O update |
| Watchdog Time | 100 ms | Communication watchdog |

## PROFINET IO System Configuration

### IO Controller Settings
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Role | IO Controller | PLC as controller |
| PROFINET Device Name | S7_1500_DOL_Control | Controller name |
| IP Address | 192.168.0.10 | Controller IP |
| Send Clock | 1 ms | PROFINET send clock |
| Number of Devices | 1-3 | Number of IO devices |
| Watchdog Time | 100 ms | Communication watchdog |

### IO Device Settings (if using remote I/O)
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Role | IO Device | Remote I/O as device |
| PROFINET Device Name | ET200SP_DOL_IO | Device name |
| IP Address | 192.168.0.11 | Device IP |
| Update Rate | 1 ms | Fast update rate |
| Watchdog Time | 100 ms | Communication watchdog |

## DCP (Discovery and Configuration Protocol)

### DCP Settings
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Enable DCP | Yes | Allow DCP configuration |
| IP Assignment | Static | Static IP assignment |
| Device Name Assignment | Manual | Manual device name |
| DHCP | Disabled | DHCP not used |

