### SNMP Settings
| Parameter | Value | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| Enable SNMP | Yes | Enable SNMP agent |
| SNMP Version | v2c | SNMP version |
| Community String | public | Read-only community |
| Trap Receiver | 192.168.0.100 | Trap destination |
| Trap Port | 162 | SNMP trap port |

